<title>USA: G&amp;K Services completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>G&amp;K Services completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>G&amp;K Services Inc, a corporate work uniform supplier, said Monday it completed the acquisition of the uniform-rental assets, plus selected linen rental assets, of National Linen Services, a division of National Service Industries Inc.</p>
<p>The cash purchase price was about $280 million, subject to adjustment after post-closing audit, G&amp;K said.</p>
<p>The acqusiition includes 29 National Linen facilities.</p>
<p>G&amp;K shares were up 1/4 at 36-5/8 early Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
